{"schemaVersion":1,"id":-40004,"sections":[{"id":"script-20004","name":"原始脚本 20004","scripts":[20004],"start":0,"count":9}],"frames":[{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20004:20004:1","scriptId":20004,"text":"听完了波西娅的解释以后，扎莉看了看手表，秒针完全处于静止状态。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":632,"speaker":"扎莉·魏特曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20004:20004:2","scriptId":20004,"text":"“那还有什么好说的呢……前进吧，反正是歼灭战车兽，很方便。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":632,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":535,"speaker":"伊达·布鲁克","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20004:20004:3","scriptId":20004,"text":"“确实，从周围的目标来看，根本没有值得一提的对手～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":632,"right":535,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":692,"speaker":"米歇尔·法梅加","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20004:20004:4","scriptId":20004,"text":"“但也不能大意，先看一看那些战车兽的反应吧，看似和真实的没有区别，但是肯定会有不同的地方吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":692,"right":535,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":535,"speaker":"伊达·布鲁克","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20004:20004:5","scriptId":20004,"text":"“米歇尔真是的，太谨慎了吧……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":692,"right":535,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":701,"speaker":"米歇尔·法梅加","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20004:20004:6","scriptId":20004,"text":"“把这里当郊游可是不对的，伊达。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":701,"right":535,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":632,"speaker":"扎莉·魏特曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20004:20004:7","scriptId":20004,"text":"“那么，折中一下，这次虽然是任务，不过放轻松点。平常不用的战术也可以在这里演练下。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":701,"right":632,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":535,"speaker":"伊达·布鲁克","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20004:20004:8","scriptId":20004,"text":"“哦也～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":535,"right":632,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":696,"speaker":"米歇尔·法梅加","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20004:20004:9","scriptId":20004,"text":"“既然队长都这么说了……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":535,"right":696,"section":0,"shake":false}],"summaries":[]}
